{"date":"2006-12-20","platform":"OVA","images":{"small":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/200/pic/cover/l/47/da/64541_6rz5c.jpg","grid":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/100/pic/cover/l/47/da/64541_6rz5c.jpg","large":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/cover/l/47/da/64541_6rz5c.jpg","medium":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/800/pic/cover/l/47/da/64541_6rz5c.jpg","common":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/400/pic/cover/l/47/da/64541_6rz5c.jpg"},"summary":"　　「Amazing Nuts!」是由[avex]和[studio 4℃]联手制作的一部新概念动画音乐特辑!打破动画的形式，将音乐与影象结合创作而成的极具前瞻性的4部动画合集。STUDIO4℃引以为傲的新锐创作者与m-flo、幸田来未、mink、RAM RIDER等引领日本乐坛的顶级歌手们创作出的极品MIX UP。与传统所谓的MUSIC CLIP相异，各部作品都是从制作中的构思与分镜到歌曲的制作等开始。除此之外，音乐与影象的完美结合、顺畅的制作流程也绝不容忽视。各部作品7分钟到10分钟不等的时间长度、给人留下鲜明强烈印象的视觉效果、音乐与影响合为一体而产生的紧凑激昂感、展现如万花筒般多采姿态的影象世界更是压轴看点。 ","name":"Amazing Nuts!","name_cn":"","tags":[{"name":"OVA","count":42,"total_count":362724},{"name":"Studio4℃","count":31,"total_count":6456},{"name":"2006","count":28,"total_count":34036},{"name":"短片","count":23,"total_count":101578},{"name":"原创","count":15,"total_count":614313},{"name":"森本晃司","count":12,"total_count":1975},{"name":"青木康浩","count":8,"total_count":42},{"name":"独立ova","count":4,"total_count":2997},{"name":"中山大輔","count":3,"total_count":3},{"name":"2006年","count":2,"total_count":1883},{"name":"旧物","count":2,"total_count":3813},{"name":"日本动画","count":2,"total_count":34754},{"name":"日本","count":2,"total_count":290487},{"name":"其他","count":1,"total_count":2890},{"name":"4°F","count":1,"total_count":1},{"name":"青木康浩中山大辅","count":1,"total_count":1},{"name":"6","count":1,"total_count":2141},{"name":"[avex]","count":1,"total_count":1},{"name":"[studio","count":1,"total_count":1},{"name":"动画","count":1,"total_count":35475},{"name":"田村晃","count":1,"total_count":1},{"name":"山下卓","count":1,"total_count":10},{"name":"中下","count":1,"total_count":38},{"name":"喜多村英梨","count":1,"total_count":3396},{"name":"2000s","count":1,"total_count":3054},{"name":"00","count":1,"total_count":470},{"name":"石田贵史","count":1,"total_count":23},{"name":"补番","count":1,"total_count":1